      "trackName": "Dare the Monkey: Go Bananas!",
      "description": "*** Over 2 Million Players Have Gone Bananas! ***\n\nMeet Dare, your daring little monkey hero! Run, jump, and roll through fast-paced, challenging levels packed with obstacles and surprises.\n\nDare the Monkey is a one-touch arcade platformer that brings classic arcade fun to your mobile device. Easy to pick up, hard to master — a skill-based adventure you won’t put down.\n\nTricky levels and fast reflexes await. Can you beat them all?\n\nWhat players are saying:\n\n“The best game ever.” 5/5  \n“Fast, fun, and addictive gameplay!” 5/5  \n“Feels like a console platformer on my phone!” 5/5  \n“Reminds me of Donkey Kong — love it!” 5/5  \n“Challenging, but so satisfying to play.” 5/5  \n“Hours of fun for casual and hardcore gamers.” 5/5\n\"Awesome game on my phone and watch.\" 5/5",
