  "versionHistory": [
    {
      "version": "1.1.1",
      "releaseNotes": "Enjoying the checkpoints we added? Good! We’ve made a few tweaks to them for you.",
      "seenAt": "2018-03-21T22:51:55Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.2",
      "releaseNotes": "We’ve got a great update for all you cheeky chimps.\n\nFinding the Double Jumps and Coin Dashes too tricky? Well good news! We’ve gone and made almost 50 of the game’s levels easier! Now you’ll be able to play your favourite platformer for longer without tearing out your fur in frustration.\n\nAlso, we’ve got great news for those who love using our level checkpoints. We’ve added three new checkpoint bundles each with amazing discounts. You’d be bananas not to give them a try.\n\nOh and finally, our code monkey has made some performance tweaks. So things should load faster and feel even zippier.\n\nThanks everyone for playing! Please keep the great reviews coming and tell all your friends!",
      "seenAt": "2018-06-18T01:51:56Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.2.1",
